{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44919","headline":"送姚中丞赴陕州 · 无可","name":"送姚中丞赴陕州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二陕周分地，恩除左掖臣。\n门阑开幕重，枪甲下天新。\n夹道行霜骑，迎风满草人。\n河流银汉水，城赛铁牛神。\n意气思高谢，依违许上陈。\n何妨向红斾，自与白云亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}